+// probe_v2134.js - v2.13.4 (known-bugs #20): the County/Regional footer "N not shown (click for why)" used to list
+// only hidden / Former / no-rows swimmers. A swimmer removed by the Gender, Age Group, Squad or name-search filter
+// vanished silently, so "N swimmer(s) shown" never added up to the roster. Now every swimmer is either shown or listed
+// exactly once in the footer, and a swimmer removed by filters is listed with the filter(s) that removed it.
+const fs = require('fs'), path = require('path');
