+## v2.13 - in progress (started October 2026)
+
+**Scope agreed:** Swimmers tab (#9) and Data tab, filter footer counts (#20), sync message redesign (#23), merge-duplicates tool, acknowledge warnings (#14), plus the three review-screen items first (#29, #30, #28). Out of scope: System Settings / maintenance mode (#27, its own session) and the Apps Script speed work.
