+## Part 3 - Summary and counts
+- [ ] **3.1** After Apply, the summary says "N already matched what's in the dashboard (no change)", and, if you used them, "N extra dashboard result(s) with the same time merged into the SE swim" / "N repeated dashboard result(s) removed".
