+- [ ] **3.3** A skipped swimmer reason reads "Swimmer no longer in the dashboard."
+- [ ] **3.4** For a suggested match whose dashboard swimmer already has a different SE #: "...already has a different SE # (xxxxxxx) in the dashboard - double-check before confirming...".
