+# Coach Dashboard - v2.13.4 test script (footer counts account for every swimmer - known-bugs #20)
+
+**What changed:** on the County QT and Regional QT tabs, a swimmer removed by the **Gender, Age Group, Squad or Search** filter used to
+vanish silently, so "N swimmer(s) shown" never added up to your roster. Now every swimmer is either shown or listed once under
+"N not shown (click for why)", and a swimmer removed by a filter is listed with the filter(s) that removed them.
+Nothing about which swimmers are shown has changed.
+
+## Part 0
+- [ ] **0.1** Tab title says **Coach Dashboard v2.13.4** (hard refresh if not).
+- [ ] **0.2** Note your roster size (📤 Manage Data shows "N swimmers loaded").
+
+## Part 1 - County QT tab
+- [ ] **1.1** With **no filters**, open "not shown (click for why)" at the bottom. **Expected:** shown + the number listed = your roster size. There is no "not matching ... filters" group.
