+- [ ] **2.1** Expand a swimmer. A strip shows **Date of birth, SE #, Source, County age group, Regional age group**.
+- [ ] **2.2** Under it a results table with **every** swimming result (not just the best): columns **Event, Course, Time, Date, Competition, Source**.
+- [ ] **2.3** Results are grouped by event (50 Free, 100 Free ... 50 Back ... IM), short course before long course, **newest first** within an event, with "└─" on repeat rows like County. An undated result shows "—".
+- [ ] **2.4** The **current best** per event and course is shown in gold; one per group.
+- [ ] **2.5** Source reads **Sheet / SE / Manual**. A swimmer with no results says "No swimming results recorded for this swimmer."
+- [ ] **2.6** Clicking ✏️ or 🗑️ does **not** expand or collapse the card.
